Geometry Wars 3D supports 8 distinct map surfaces: sphere, torus, peanut, pill, cube, Möbius strip, sphere-tunnel (bevel), and a flat surface. Each surface requires specialized UV handling, tangent frame computation, and collision detection. New features must work correctly across all surfaces in both single-player (via GameLoop.ts) and multiplayer (via network-main.ts) code paths. SP and MP code paths are entirely separate — changes to one do not automatically apply to the other.
